<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69086" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μῠκήνη</span></b> , ἡ, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μῠκῆναι</span></b> , αἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Mycene,
			Mycenae</i>: <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> uses both sg. (<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.304
			</span></i>, al.), and pl. (only in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.569
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.376
			</span></i>); the pl. prevails in 
				Att.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.10
			</span></i>, etc.:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μῠκηναῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
				<u>Mycenaean</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.638
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Dor.
			
			Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μῠκᾱνεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>, ὁ, <i>a
				Mycenaean</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				31
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>):—fem. Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μῠκηνίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				16.12
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>: Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μῠκήνηθεν</span></b> , <i>from
				Mycene</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.44
			</span></i>: 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μῠκᾱνέᾱθεν</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.492
			</span></i> (Mycenae, <span class="entity">vi B. C.</span>).</div>
